===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|inorganic compound}} A [[colourless]] [[liquid]], H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub>, soluble in [[water]], used as a mild [[antiseptic]], [[bleaching agent]] (especially for bleaching [[hair]]), [[oxidizing agent]] and [[chemical]] [[reagent]].

